      'You know why the record fails exactly when it matters — the year that produces a dispute and the year too busy to write things down are the same year.',
      'Carry it out this week: name the record you resent most, write what it has ALREADY produced for you, and keep it this year as service rather than compliance. Then notice whether you keep it better.',
